#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-sf02.rst:5
#: 3435479d437248b887b74789cae65d9f 3ad296fa894d4bf6aff3cd646a572581
#: 74c7333f8d624360a34bf8d13ca3d026 961b218ce91b4b53a981d09aa70f8be2
#: d34a4341506b427e8ae90b7c264e345b
msgid "Lightware SF02 Rangefinder"
msgstr "Lightware SF02 测距仪"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-sf02.rst:7
#: 6a03449a981049fa9854927a439ba59d 7661a5616a7649699103ce7b2816c7e9
#: b0e88c3b1a2d4306adfe5db41fe8a581 ee23738619534c66a6f02f54afcbd3ef
#: fa0a70d73d944ae7bc209089e33b0e25
msgid ""
"The `Lightware SF02 "
"<http://documents.lightware.co.za/SF02%20-%20Laser%20Rangefinder%20Manual%20-%20Rev%2012.pdf>`__"
" is lightweight laser rangefinder module that provides fast and accurate "
"distance measurements up to 40 meters (130 feet). In `tests by the "
"development team <https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/testing-laser-"
"rangefinders-with-arduplane>`__ the sensor has produced very reliable "
"distance measurements for long and short ranges even on fast moving "
"vehicles."
msgstr ""
"`Lightware SF02 "
"<http://documents.lightware.co.za/SF02%20-%20Laser%20Rangefinder%20Manual%20-%20Rev%2012.pdf>`__"
" 是一款轻量激光测距模块，可实现最远 40 米（130 英尺）的快速精准测距。在 `开发团队的测试 "
"<https://diydrones.com/profiles/blogs/testing-laser-rangefinders-with-"
"arduplane>`__ 中，即使在高速运动的飞行器上，该传感器在远距和近距测量中均表现出极高的可靠性。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-sf02.rst:15
#: 4631b436f48b4406987fa4d3065bb751 8f01f075663f4516a292407a24145ecc
#: 952cb279df8e4175845488d5197fa63e c63784c0f51c46838072b515cda1db37
#: fe1b4f1847f34f53b5196eaf5aa17721
msgid "Connecting to the Pixhawk"
msgstr "连接至 Pixhawk"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-sf02.rst:17
#: 1a6214def12f4063b86e4f3061fc5c6e 50d8a7ca2d7a486cafd9ab56343820bf
#: 625eacc86d2f4f569eec90e641d7f6db 77b41d82d2744ac38f618903b9072a0b
#: 8f58da04b72f464b973541128a4e0476
msgid ""
"The SF02's Analog Out pin should be connected to the Pixhawk's 3.3V ADC "
"(analog to digital converter) as shown below.  The Pixhawk will provide the "
"regulated 5V power supply the sensor requires."
msgstr ""
"SF02 的模拟输出引脚应连接至 Pixhawk 的 3.3V ADC（模数转换器）接口，如下图所示。Pixhawk 将为传感器提供所需的稳压 5V "
"电源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-sf02.rst:25
#: 5cb8f97febd148efade09f38d08313d7 7267dfef19f84be491ab35c2de0dd9c4
#: b8cee00acc004badb2386cecf1f46ed0 dd578ebfc7b7468fbf189e050ca510c5
#: e3ddeb28720f4fa7bf91562a990a1463
msgid "Setup through the mission planner"
msgstr "通过 Mission Planner 设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-sf02.rst:27
#: 98fdd0935eee45a7a1bdcb909303f42b ae6faa6c39d040dcb736aa73c356864a
#: cd843866f3814776b8df4385f05a2e97 df0b22ff04274939bc0c961544e6d6b2
#: e5c5b47021474ff3b9dba6a5453331d9
msgid ""
"To configure Copter, Plane or Rover to use the LIDAR-Lite, please first "
"connect with the Mission Planner and then open the Config/Tuning >> Full "
"Parameter List page and set:"
msgstr ""
"如需配置 Copter、Plane 或 Rover 使用 LIDAR-Lite，请先连接 Mission Planner，然后打开「配置/调参 >> "
"完整参数列表」页面并设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rangefinder-sf02.rst:31
#: 0ff83a01fb27442b87c41d27bd791acd 52214dc1c1f94bf8b8a0276c3ec26fda
#: 80522fb682f14e44be5efa66e3e203d0 86575dd6b2ab4c6a9b5d0d6cb106d7b1
#: d3f94f1446534649af31bcd68b54d88d
msgid ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 37 (i.e. 40m max range - 3m buffer.  This"
" buffer is required so the flight code can detect when there is nothing in "
"range)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`RNGFND1_MAX <RNGFND1_MAX>` = 37（即最大量程 40m 减去 3m "
"缓冲。此缓冲用于使飞控能检测到量程外无目标的情况）"

